      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three sites in Loudonville sit on the National Register of Historic Places: the Ohio Theatre, Water Street, and the historic village core.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
